| Motors, safety, kinematics | `control/{subsystem}/{slug}` |
| Rust, Consul, proto, CI | `software/{crate}/{slug}` |
| Research distillations | `research/{domain}/{slug}` |
| Stable heuristics | `expert/{domain}/{slug}` |

